      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town once ran the narrow‑gauge East Tennessee and Western North Carolina Railroad, nicknamed \"Tweetsie,\" until a 1940 flood washed away the tracks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
